<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#F5F7FA',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 8 }}>CLARIFY</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 24 }}>需求澄清的价值：多问一句，少返工十次</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, background: '#22D3EE', marginBottom: 26 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: '26px 26px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 14 }}>
          <FAIcon name='question-circle' style={{ fill: '#5B6B7A', width: 28, height: 28 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F' }}>开发者自己猜</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>
          需求一句话，剩下的全靠猜<br />
          → 猜错方向，白干半天<br />
          → 交付时才发现不对 → 返工
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 16, background: '#F5F7FA', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>成本：高返工、低信任</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#16263F', borderRadius: 14, padding: '26px 26px' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 14 }}>
          <FAIcon name='comments' style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 28, height: 28 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>结构化提问</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>
          把模糊点变成一个个具体问题<br />
          → 一问一答，和 AI 对齐理解<br />
          → 需求锁定后再 plan → 返工锐减
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 16, background: 'rgba(255,159,28,0.15)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>成本：一次对齐，长期省</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 20, background: '#DCE7F5', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 22px' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
        心法：带着猜测进 plan，必返工——澄清是性价比最高的一步
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 9 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>04 / 12</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
